  "details": "Since there isn't an appropriate category for this kind of feedback, I'm posting this here.\nCurrently every single item on the VRchat threadless store is just the logo slapped on everything.\nWhy not sell real-life mugs of those you see in the dev streams?\nT-shirts with the VRchat emoji splashed all over them, pillowcase with the very old diamond loading screen, hoodies with very poor avatar rating...\nAn actual Nikei hoodie would be awesome.\n\nThe website in question: https://vrchat.threadless.com/",
